   "source": [
    "The key variables we will use are"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "041658d4-6cba-4eab-b139-cbe80d4b9e9c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Here are our research questions:\n",
    "1. **Natalie - Are there systemic differences in how men and women evaluate their partners?** Many findings suggest men weigh attractiveness more heavily, whereas women weigh traits like ambition and intelligence. This dataset provides real in-person observations that may support or refute that claim.\n",
    "\n",
    "2. **Delaney - Does a participant’s likelihood of saying \"yes\" or rating a date highly decline as the round number increases?**\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "3. **Aya - Are people who know what they want in a partner more successful at finding mutual matches?**"
   ]
  },
